### 결제 요청
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments
X-Loopers-LoginId: loopers123
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Loopers123!
Idempotency-Key: payment-order-1-attempt-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451"
}

### 결제 요청 재시도 - 같은 Idempotency-Key
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments
X-Loopers-LoginId: loopers123
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Loopers123!
Idempotency-Key: payment-order-1-attempt-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451"
}

### 결제 상태 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: loopers123
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Loopers123!

### 결제 상태 동기화
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/1/sync
X-Loopers-LoginId: loopers123
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Loopers123!

### PG 콜백 수신 예시
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionKey": "20250816:TR:9577c5",
  "orderId": "replace-with-order-number",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451",
  "amount": 5000,
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "reason": "정상 승인되었습니다."
}
